      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- BILINGUAL + SUPPLIER DIVERSITY VALUE -->
  <section class="section" style="background:var(--bg-secondary);">
    <div class="container" style="max-width:800px;text-align:center;">
      <div class="section-header reveal">
        <div class="section-label">Supplier Diversity</div>
        <h2 class="section-title">Your Goals, Our Partnership</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="reveal" style="color:var(--text-secondary);line-height:1.8;max-width:640px;margin:0 auto;">
        <p style="margin-bottom:24px;">Certified Minority Business Enterprise (MBE) through NMSDC — eligible to help you meet corporate supplier diversity goals. Participant in the SBA 8(a) Business Development Program — qualified for sole-source and set-aside federal contracts.</p>
        <p style="margin-bottom:24px;">State-certified Small Business — recognized for participation in state and local government procurement programs across all 58 California counties.</p>
        <div style="background:var(--bg-card);border-radius:var(--radius);padding:24px;margin-top:24px;">
          <p style="font-size:18px;color:var(--accent);font-weight:600;margin-bottom:8px;">Se habla español</p>
          <p style="color:var(--text-muted);font-size:14px;">Full bilingual service available — English & Spanish. Better communication with diverse communities and clients.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- CONTRACT VEHICLES -->
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container" style="max-width:900px;">
      <div class="section-header reveal">
        <div class="section-label">Contract Vehicles</div>
        <h2 class="section-title">How to Engage CC3PO</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="proof-grid reveal" style="grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(260px,1fr));gap:20px;">
        <div class="proof-card" style="text-align:center;">
          <div style="font-size:32px;margin-bottom:12px;color:#00e676;">✅</div>
          <h3 style="color:var(--text-primary);margin-bottom:8px;">SB/DVBE Option</h3>
          <p style="color:var(--text-muted);font-size:14px;">Active. Direct awards $5K–$249,999.99. No competitive bid required. California state agencies.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="proof-card" style="text-align:center;">
          <div style="font-size:32px;margin-bottom:12px;color:#ffd700;">🔜</div>
          <h3 style="color:var(--text-primary);margin-bottom:8px;">CMAS</h3>
          <p style="color:var(--text-muted);font-size:14px;">Pursuing. California Multiple Award Schedule. Enables repeat purchases without individual bidding.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="proof-card" style="text-align:center;">
          <div style="font-size:32px;margin-bottom:12px;color:#4fc3f7;">📋</div>
          <h3 style="color:var(--text-primary);margin-bottom:8px;">Custom SOW</h3>
          <p style="color:var(--text-muted);font-size:14px;">Firm-fixed-price or labor-category pricing. FAR-compliant. Scope-based engagement for any contract size.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- CTA -->
  <section class="section" id="cta" style="background:var(--bg-secondary);">
    <div class="container" style="max-width:700px;text-align:center;">
      <div class="section-header reveal">
        <h2 class="section-title">Ready to Work With CC3PO?</h2>
        <p class="section-desc">Download our capability statement or contact us for procurement.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-buttons reveal">
        <a href="/contact" class="btn btn-primary btn-glow"><span class="btn-icon">📧</span> Contact for Procurement</a>
        <a href="/government" class="btn btn-secondary"><span class="btn-icon">🏛️</span> Government Services</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Footer -->
  <footer class="footer">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="footer-grid">
        <div class="footer-brand">
          <div style="font-size:17px;font-weight:800;margin-bottom:8px;">CC3PO</div>
          <p>AI Agents That Work Within Your Rules.</p>
          <div style="margin-top:16px;font-size:0.75rem;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.35);">
            <strong style="color:rgba(255,255,255,0.5);">Certifications:</strong> CA Small Business SB #2052063 · Latino-Owned · SB/DVBE Option · <a href="/certifications" style="color:var(--accent);">View All →</a>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="footer-col">
          <div class="footer-col-title">Services</div>
          <div class="footer-col-links">
            <a href="/services">All Services</a>
            <a href="/accessibility">Accessibility</a>
            <a href="/government">Government</a>
            <a href="/ai-compliance">AI Compliance</a>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="footer-col">
          <div class="footer-col-title">Company</div>
          <div class="footer-col-links">
            <a href="/#founder">About</a>
            <a href="/certifications">Certifications</a>
            <a href="/village">The Village</a>
            <a href="/contact">Contact</a>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="footer-col">
          <div class="footer-col-title">Legal</div>
          <div class="footer-col-links">
            <a href="/accessibility-statement">Accessibility Statement</a>
            <a href="/privacy/">Privacy Policy</a>
            <a href="/terms/">Terms of Service</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="footer-bottom">
        <div class="footer-copy">© 2026 CC3PO LLC. All rights reserved.</div>
        <div class="footer-legal">
          <a href="/privacy/">Privacy</a>
          <a href="/terms/">Terms</a>
          <a href="/accessibility-statement">Accessibility</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </footer>

  <script is:inline>
    const nav = document.getElementById('nav');
    let scrollTicking = false;
    window.addEventListener('scroll', () => {
      if (!scrollTicking) {
        requestAnimationFrame(() => {
          nav.classList.toggle('nav-scrolled', window.scrollY > 50);
          scrollTicking = false;
        });
        scrollTicking = true;
      }
    });
    const revealObserver = new IntersectionObserver((entries) => {
      entries.forEach(entry => { if (entry.isIntersecting) { entry.target.classList.add('revealed'); revealObserver.unobserve(entry.target); } });
    }, { threshold: 0.15 });
    document.querySelectorAll('.reveal').forEach(el => revealObserver.observe(el));
    // Mobile drawer handled by Layout.astro